  "body": "The xtask test `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` fails on main.\n\nThe test is in `xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs`. It prints this message:\n\n`suites without a Gate map: [\"sinumerik_810m_post\"]`\n\nThe cause is PR #3317. It added `crates/app/tests/sinumerik_810m_post.rs`. The file has no `Gate map:` line in its module doc.\n\nDone means:\n- The file has a `Gate map:` doc line that names the modules the test covers.\n- The line names no moved module as `app::<module>`.\n- The xtask test is green.\n",
